<h1 class="nm-h1" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;line-height:34px;font-weight:600;color:#1B2B4B;">
  {{senderName}} sent you a message
</h1>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin:0 0 22px;">
  <tr><td style="padding:18px 22px;background-color:#F5F3EE;border-left:3px solid #C9A84C;border-radius:6px;">
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#374151;font-style:italic;">{{messagePreview}}</p>
  </td></tr>
</table>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="nm-cta" style="margin:0 0 8px;">
  <tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#1B2B4B" style="border-radius:8px;">
    <a href="{{conversationUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 32px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Reply to {{senderName}}</a>
  </td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:18px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#9CA3AF;">
  Replying promptly is the single biggest predictor of a conversation going somewhere.
</p>
